# Generated public-contract records. Marking them generated keeps them out of
# language stats and out of blame, and collapses them by default in forge
# diffs, while `check:api-surface` / `check:api-declarations` keep gating their
# freshness. Deliberately not `-diff`: that makes Git treat them as binary, and
# the reviewable declaration diff is the whole reason these files are tracked.
packages/*/api-declarations.md linguist-generated=true
